OL,3,GNEWSACoogan backs 'great things' to
OL,4,Acome from mill revival
OL,5,
OL,6,FComedian Steve Coogan says a deal to
OL,7,Facquire an historic cotton mill could
OL,8,F"lead on to great things" as he helped
OL,9,Flead regeneration plans in his hometown
OL,10,Fof Middleton, in Greater Manchester.
OL,12,FRochdale Borough Council said it had
OL,13,Fstruck a deal to acquire Grade
OL,14,FII-listed Warwick Mill, vacant for at
OL,15,Fleast a decade, after a consultation of
OL,16,Fmore than 2,000 people.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
