OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACoogan backs 'great things' to
OL,4,Acome from mill revival
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Bafta-winning actor co-chairs the
OL,7,Fshadow board setting up Middleton's
OL,8,Fproposed mayoral development
OL,9,Fcorporation (MDC), which would have
OL,10,Fpowers to buy land and drive
OL,11,Fdevelopment.
OL,13,FAt Middleton Arena, Coogan said
OL,14,Fresidents should be involved "from the
OL,15,Fground up", with regeneration done
OL,16,F"with people, not to them".
